{
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "standard",
      "summary": "Pine Trees are found in cold biomes. Cut one down, and let the logs or planks sit out until they weather and rot. Then use them to build spooky houses!",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "literal_text": null,
          "text": " Sunflower Oil can be used to halt the aging process. Use the Oil on the wood to preserve it, but remember, this change is permanent. You can't un-oil wood!\n\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/blocks/pine_log.png",
          "caption": "happyhallows.guide_book.chapters.blocks.pine_log_caption",
          "image_width": 116,
          "image_height": 29
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "standard",
      "summary": "Each age of Pine Planks can be crafted into:\n-Stairs\n-Slabs\n-Fences & Gates\n-Pressure Plates\n-Buttons\n-Doors\n-Trapdoors",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/blocks/pine.png",
          "caption": "happyhallows.guide_book.chapters.blocks.pine_caption",
          "image_width": 116,
          "image_height": 83
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "literal_text": null,
          "text": "These blocks use the same recipe formats as regular blocks, but will accept either regular or preserved planks."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "standard",
      "summary": "There are two new types of fences in HappyHallows: A Wrought Iron Fence, and Picket Fences.\n\nThe Wrought Iron Fence Gate makes a creepy squeak when opened.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/fences/iron_fence.png",
          "caption": "happyhallows.guide_book.chapters.blocks.iron_fence_caption",
          "image_width": 116,
          "image_height": 68
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "literal_text": null,
          "text": "It's perfect for graveyards or keeping mobs and traveling salesmen* at bay.\n\n*Restrictions may apply."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "standard",
      "summary": "Iron Fence and Gate crafting recipes are shown here:",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image_path": "textures/gui/guide/chapters/fences/craft_iron_fence.png",
